        <mxCell id="adminui" value="admin-ui (Next.js 14)\n대시보드·모니터링·분석·예산\n사용자/팀·모델·RateLimit·키\n/chat (BI) · Glass 디자인" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
